      data:
        _guid: 6374ae74e1a946a890cf6d9af736905f
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A burrower (sandworm, mole, tunnelling drill — any faction): sinks underground and erupts right beside its target with a burst that hurts and shoves everyone close (EnemyData › Kit › Signature: a Burrow ability), strikes while surfaced, and dives again as soon as it can.'
